{"skill":{"slug":"elevenlabs-voices","displayName":"elevenlabs-voices"},"version":{"version":"2.2.0","createdAt":1788192730120,"changelog":"OpenClaw 2.0 compatibility: corrected frontmatter, automations CLI, and documentation. Verified against a live OpenClaw 2026.8.1 install.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","size":1530,"sha256":"6091112839f9b610592d1189eab06144ff048e413c72cc9989fc881aacf0b1c5","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"LICENSE","size":1062,"sha256":"e12033f72dc2e8d7dbbcf99ff45646cb8a9c20200f7536581e64afac52c29a8d","contentType":"application/octet-stream"},{"path":"README.md","size":1806,"sha256":"9d4f8986727110f1b6df9c36c9d17b38e7843dda345b5d729e9100537744c142","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":13481,"sha256":"a1bc7394678bc72e9b9349415d692b4124a8d39537ec930abf227c97105e7f6b","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"examples.md","size":14107,"sha256":"de74e902bef52f56b736287a714eac2b6703dad38eaf9dc0a8e791041270af9f","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"pronunciations.json","size":1603,"sha256":"e3e2ad5dde61cb6e2656d52d6ae1f6b1bbd71f0fa0ebbadef3a7455ed202e3d7","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"references/voice-guide.md","size":8006,"sha256":"bb447bf045b686a94bb9cc6f96d2a54ef5deabd814c4b27cf1e82bba52111250","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"scripts/setup.py","size":10507,"sha256":"0be510b307d61839d93f0561f52c8c65dcd8343cf0a8e5c87c7fad0839c9e3a3","contentType":"application/octet-stream"},{"path":"scripts/sfx.py","size":9464,"sha256":"6deaf2d41b1c4d7fa91a6599136b32d482a5a66e3149a67420287ef5b4afa7d7","contentType":"application/octet-stream"},{"path":"scripts/tts.py","size":17591,"sha256":"25932764bb9515f699bf338fcc80439f28ce62e06981ab7be8a7e1246eb3cdb1","contentType":"application/octet-stream"},{"path":"scripts/voice-design.py","size":11355,"sha256":"58e1586e2b68923d2b2b5dc1ea74e40264aca6e60cda03bf36175db5bd67dd7d","contentType":"application/octet-stream"},{"path":"voices.json","size":8356,"sha256":"32e1e68fda8d4f01b3c0133593e1f3abf4d71100cf3d54c4a54697d3d32da760","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2714,"sha256":"bae930e65201f7c0abdff538ff36007c3f6e0b58ae9e48466fe393f2d153b0e9","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789017738742,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"7698f627bf60b9251e5561b5f83314d4175bb217b6ab191d9f6eee8d276058a7","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/7698f627bf60b9251e5561b5f83314d4175bb217b6ab191d9f6eee8d276058a7","scanners":{"vt":null,"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":100,"severity":"CRITICAL","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","issueCount":47,"checkedAt":1789017738742},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is mostly a straightforward ElevenLabs audio tool, but its API-key storage claims and batch file-output handling need review before installation.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Reading an ElevenLabs key from environment or a skill-local .env is purpose-aligned, but the setup wizard also stores a plaintext key in config.json without explicit restrictive permissions and the batch output paths can write outside the requested output directory.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"There is no automatic installer, dependency installation, background setup, or remote code retrieval; use is via user-invoked Python scripts.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The documentation and setup wizard say the API key never leaves the machine and is automatically in .gitignore, but normal operation sends the key to ElevenLabs and no .gitignore is present in the artifact.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The skill persists local usage stats and, through setup.py, can persist the API key in config.json; there is no service or backdoor persistence, but plaintext credential persistence is a material review issue.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The TTS, sound-effect, voice-design, language, batch, and usage-tracking capabilities match the stated ElevenLabs voice-synthesis purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install only after reviewing the credential handling. Prefer environment variables or a secure secret manager instead of running setup.py, avoid committing config.json or .env, rotate any key that may have been saved or shared, and process only trusted batch JSON until output-path validation is fixed. Expect submitted text, sound prompts, voice-design descriptions, preview text, and the API key to be sent to ElevenLabs over HTTPS.","findings":"[TT3] expected: The flagged environment-to-network flow is the ElevenLabs API key being placed in the xi-api-key header for official ElevenLabs API calls; that is expected for this cloud API and is not evidence of unrelated credential exfiltration.\n[TP4] expected: Network calls and local file writes are disclosed in the skill docs and are coherent with generating audio, but the skill should more accurately disclose that text, prompts, preview text, and the API key are sent to ElevenLabs.\n[AE1] unexpected: The referenced scripts, including scripts/sfx.py, were present in the artifact and inspected; I found no artifact-backed analysis-evasion behavior.\n[P6] unexpected: The 'Show prompt examples' text refers to sound-effect prompt examples, not system prompt extraction; I found no instruction to reveal system or developer prompts.\n[PE3] expected: Access to ELEVEN_API_KEY, ELEVENLABS_API_KEY, and a skill-local .env is expected for an ElevenLabs integration, but local plaintext secret handling remains a security weakness.\n[T09] unexpected: The batch TTS and SFX scripts use output filenames from batch JSON without containment checks, allowing absolute or traversal paths to create or overwrite user-writable files outside the selected output directory.\n[T09] unexpected: The setup wizard stores the API key in plaintext config.json, does not enforce owner-only permissions, and the artifact lacks the documented .gitignore protection.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789017738742}}}}}